== .
rule: value-U+0002 control-byte
rule: value-U+000B control-byte
rule: expiry-U+00B2 expiry
rule: char-numeric-U+00B2 #t
== mut/control-enumerated
rule: value-U+0002 #f
rule: value-U+000B #f
rule: expiry-U+00B2 expiry
rule: char-numeric-U+00B2 #t
== mut/expiry-char-numeric
rule: value-U+0002 control-byte
rule: value-U+000B control-byte
rule: expiry-U+00B2 (raised <=)
rule: char-numeric-U+00B2 #t
